      "type": "stat",
      "title": "30d utilization",
      "description": "Go window utilization: opencode_subscription_usage_usd{window=\"30d\"} / 60 (list-price usage-value; 5h/$12 · 7d/$30 · 30d/$60). Threshold green→orange at 0.8. Metered = cluster+jail; console = spot-check only. No data = no Go spend.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 4, "x": 20, "y": 27 },
